# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ARCHTYP website environment
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. All values are optional in dev:
# without a key, the access/inquiry endpoint logs the payload and
# gracefully no-ops so the build and forms still work end to end.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Attio CRM (https://developers.attio.com) — destination for Request access /
# Register interest / Contact submissions. The endpoint is written behind a
# clean seam (lib/crm.ts) so this can be swapped for any CRM.
ATTIO_API_KEY=
# Slug of the Attio object that receives leads (e.g. "people" or a custom object).
ATTIO_OBJECT=people
# Optional: a list id to also attach the new record to.
ATTIO_LIST=

# Public site URL, used for canonical/OG/sitemap. Set in production.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://archtyp.ai
